{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/tinkerbell-community/archive2disk","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:17:00.827Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/tbaction/tinkerbell-community/archive2disk","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/tbaction/tinkerbell-community/archive2disk"},"readme":"The below example will stream a compressed root filesystem into archive2disk, where it will be written to the filesystem on the block device `/dev/sda3`.\n\nArchive types supported:\n\n* `tar`: standard tar archive\n* `targz`: A gzipped tar archive (compressed)\n```\nactions:\n    - name: \"expand ubuntu filesystem to root\"\n      image: quay.io/tinkerbell-actions/archive2disk:v1.0.0\n      timeout: 90\n      environment:\n          ARCHIVE_URL: http://192.168.1.2/ubuntu.tar.gz\n          ARCHIVE_TYPE: targz\n          DEST_DISK: /dev/sda3\n          FS_TYPE: ext4\n          DEST_PATH: /\n```","readmeBase":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions","publisher":{"name":"Tinkerbell Community","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=tinkerbell-community","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2021-02-10T12:41:45.000Z","categories":[],"keywords":["disk"],"license":"Apache-2","links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions"},{"name":"website","url":"https://tinkerbell.org/"},{"name":"support","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/actions/issues"},{"name":"Tinkerbell Community repository","url":"https://github.com/tinkerbell/hub/actions"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":2,"subscriptions":0},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.0.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2021-02-10T12:41:45.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"1.0.0"}],"tagsTotal":1,"security":{"low":0,"high":0,"medium":0,"unknown":0,"critical":0},"install":null,"version":"1.0.0","appVersion":"1.0.0","containersImages":["quay.io